        dct:description "D_u sweep panel and control flags — docs/media/fractofusus_misrai_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-fractofusus-misrai-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d, image/png, 726931 B, 1344×1008 px, artifact_sha256 764499f45bf6c5c2be034bc5a534df51a43eb1cfe24db598fe40d9c0f486fac2 (sha256 764499f45bf6c5c2be034bc5a534df51a43eb1cfe24db598fe40d9c0f486fac2), spec_fingerprint b7aed75670ec58eb2e24b6b33d4964b84814f0e27b8d16305477ab4160932f43" .
